                        "entry_id": "dab97ea0-8179-348a-9d7a-71e2cdde3990",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Resembling or characteristic of a Sunday, especially in terms of the religious observances and abstinence from work of the Christian Sabbath."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aedef66a-d4e1-4f05-9488-a3b0ead16960",
                                "sense_id": "1b0e7844-00a8-3d2f-b317-edf5a64065d2",
                                "text": "Hence the un-Sundaylike demeanor of the procession, for few towns hold it more unseemly to stand and stare at passers-by, especially on the Sabbath."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "435d039c-84fc-4c53-8fd0-678fc8fa6b4a",
                                "sense_id": "1b0e7844-00a8-3d2f-b317-edf5a64065d2",
                                "text": "In riding through these counties, the stranger is painfully impressed with the Sundaylike stillness that everywhere prevails..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0c8c813-9e10-46c8-95d8-8ab58ada9888",
                                "sense_id": "1b0e7844-00a8-3d2f-b317-edf5a64065d2",
                                "text": "We drive sleepily into London along broad thoroughfares where to eyes fresh from New York the traffic seems sparse and Sundaylike."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
